Package: timetracker
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: per-task time tracking application for V\OS
 TimeTracker records time spent on named tasks: a list view with
 start/stop per task, a new-task card and saved totals.
